# Personal Skills Repository

- Use `AGENTS.md` as the shared repo instructions.
- Treat `skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md` as the canonical source for each skill.
- Read directly linked files under `skills/<skill-name>/references/` only when the skill asks for them.
- Keep Cursor-specific rules thin; use focused `.mdc` rules that reference canonical skill files with `@skills/...` instead of duplicating full skill content.
